{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Nice job, Ed!\" Roy shouts from a bit away.\n\"Ah. Honestly, not sure, I can only guess. My guess is that he does have something in mind, but for now is inviting people in a way that will cover more bases. But again, that's just my guess. I promised I won't tell anyone about anything from inside the cottage, I ask that you trust me on this and let me keep that secret.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T19:56:38.189000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869669633005879316","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
